+sets \(\{0\}\times A\), with \(A\in\mathcal F_0\), and
+\((r,\infty)\times A\), with \(A\in\mathcal F_r\).  It is enough to check
+the inverse image of each generator under \(\omega\mapsto(t,\omega)\).
