+\((r,\infty)\times A\), the section is empty if \(t\le r\), and is exactly
+\(A\) if \(r<t\).  In the nonempty case \(A\in\mathcal F_r\), and
+\(\mathcal F_r\) is one of the sigma-algebras included in
